cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sansdir in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "sansdir: a keyboard-driven terminal file manager and reduction front-end for SANS and USANS data"
abstract: >-
  A dual-pane terminal user interface for navigating, inspecting, plotting and
  reducing small-angle and ultra-small-angle neutron scattering data on the
  ORNL analysis cluster. Includes OnCat catalog integration, NeXus metadata
  extraction, detector masking, USANS reduction table generation, and
  desmearing by truncated Abel inversion.
type: software
authors:
